msgstr "Limitado"

#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:219
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Determines whether the range of possible color values needs to be limited for "
"the display. This should only be changed if the colors on the screen look wash"
"ed out."
msgstr ""
"Determina se limitar o intervalo de valores de cores posíbeis para a pantalla."
" Isto só debería cambiarse se as cores na pantalla semellan descoloridas."

#. +> stable5
#: package/contents/ui/OutputPanel.qml:73
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"&quot;%1&quot; is the only resolution supported by this display.<nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"Using unsupported resolutions was possible in the Plasma X11 session, but they"
" were never guaranteed to work and are not available in this Plasma Wayland se"
"ssion."
msgstr ""
"«%1» é a única resolución que permite esta pantalla.<nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"Usar resolucións incompatíbeis era posíbel na sesión de X11 de Plasma, pero nu"
"nca se garantiu que funcionasen e non están dispoñíbeis nesta sesión de Waylan"
"d de Plasma."

