#, kde-format
msgctxt "The system will perform the x11 apps scaling"
msgid "Scaled by the system"
msgstr "Escala do sistema"

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/Panel.qml:143
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"All legacy applications will be scaled by the system to the correct size, howe"
"ver they will always look slightly blurry."
msgstr ""
"O sistema escalará todas as aplicacións antigas ao tamaño correcto, porén semp"
"re se verán un pouco borrosas."

#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: ui/Panel.qml:148
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Screen tearing:"
msgstr "Rotura de pantalla:"

#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: ui/Panel.qml:151
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@option:check The thing being allowed in fullscreen windows is screen tearing"
msgid "Allow in fullscreen windows"
msgstr "Permitir en xanelas a pantalla completa"

#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: ui/Panel.qml:156
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Screen tearing reduces latency with most displays. Note that not all graphics "
"drivers support this setting."
msgstr ""
"A rotura de pantalla reduce a latencia coa maioría das pantallas. Teña en cont"
"a que non todos os controladores gráficos permiten esta opción."

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/Panel.qml:170
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The global scale factor is limited to multiples of 6.25% to minimize visual gl"
"itches in applications using the X11 windowing system."
msgstr ""
"O factor de escala global está limitado a múltiplos de 6.25% para minimizar os"
" problemas visuais en aplicacións que usan o sistema de xanelas X11."

